<title>RUSSIA: Russia Surgutneftegaz net up to 1.9 trln rbls.</title>
<headline>Russia Surgutneftegaz net up to 1.9 trln rbls.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's OAO Surgutneftegaz oil production company reported 1996 net profits of 1.9 trillion roubles, up slightly from 1.8 trillion in 1995, the company said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Surgut did not make clear to what accounting standard the profits were calculated.</p>
<p>The board of directors of Surgut, a subsidiary of NK Surgutneftegaz holding company, the third largest Russian oil producer, had recommended unchanged dividends of 130 roubles for preferred shares and 35 roubles for ordinary shares, a company statement said.</p>
</text>
